{
  "id": "decode-ways",
  "order": 39,
  "title": "Decode Ways",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "pattern": "1D dynamic programming",
  "statement": "Letters A-Z are encoded as `\"1\"` to `\"26\"`. Given a digit string `s`, return how many ways it can be decoded. `\"06\"` is not a valid code for F.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= s.length <= 100",
    "s contains only digits"
  ],
  "function": {
    "name": "numDecodings",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "s",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int"
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(n)",
    "space": "O(1)"
  },
  "hints": [
    "How does the last one digit, or the last two digits, extend the earlier decodings?",
    "ways(i) = ways(i-1) if s[i] != '0', plus ways(i-2) if s[i-1..i] is between 10 and 26.",
    "Roll two variables through the string. Zeros are the trap: a '0' can only be the second digit of 10 or 20."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        "12"
      ],
      "expected": 2,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "\"AB\" or \"L\"."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "226"
      ],
      "expected": 3,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "BZ, VF, BBF."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "06"
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "Leading zero, so 0."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "0"
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "10"
      ],
      "expected": 1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "100"
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "27"
      ],
      "expected": 1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "1111"
      ],
      "expected": 5,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "310922112"
      ],
      "expected": 8,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "2"
      ],
      "expected": 1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "1028468220"
      ],
      "expected": 1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "716825211771"
      ],
      "expected": 20,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "92230980691"
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "034238526"
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
